@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> ValidateCriteria : Receive cleanup request
ValidateCriteria --> ProcessData : Criteria validated successfully
ValidateCriteria --> ErrorState : Criteria validation failed
ProcessData --> CheckCompletion : Data processing completed
CheckCompletion --> NotifyUser : Cleanup completed successfully
CheckCompletion --> ErrorState : Cleanup failed
NotifyUser --> [*] : Return to idle state
ErrorState --> NotifyUser : Send error notification
ErrorState --> [*] : Return to idle state
@enduml
